# Responsible Use Notice

The Nation-State Lab project is an educational cybersecurity laboratory designed to support learning, research, defensive security validation, detection engineering, threat hunting, and authorised security testing.

This repository may contain infrastructure configurations, attack simulations, detection content, automation scripts, and adversary emulation techniques intended solely for use within isolated and controlled environments.

By using, modifying, or distributing this project, you agree to the following:

* Use the project only for educational, research, training, or authorised security assessment purposes.
* Conduct testing only against systems, networks, and environments for which you have explicit permission.
* Comply with all applicable laws, regulations, and organisational policies.
* Accept full responsibility for any actions performed using the software, configurations, documentation, or techniques contained within this repository.

The authors, contributors, and maintainers do not endorse, encourage, or accept responsibility for any unauthorised, illegal, or malicious use of this project.

